# radroots_runtime_store

## Compatibility quarantine

This package is a private, publish-frozen migration implementation. New
integrations must classify state into `radroots_storage`,
`radroots_storage_sqlite`, or an explicit host-private store. The standalone CLI
still consumes this broad predecessor boundary. Step 313 removes this package
after downstream cutover; adding new consumers is forbidden by
`RCRV1-DEV-009`.

Shared runtime-store primitives for same-host Rad Roots runtimes.

This crate owns the SQLite schema and typed API for the `shared/runtime_store`
namespace. It is an interop store for local work records, signed event records,
publish outbox status, relay delivery metadata, and projection cursors. It is
not an application primary database.
